<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Go1den Cape - 110,000/10 tonnes coal Santa Marta/Wilhelmshaven end July $7.80 fio 22,500 shinc/20,000 shex Preag.</p>
<p>Cho Yang TBN - 130,000 tonnes coal Newcastle/Kwangyang 16-30/7 $6.48 fio seven days shinc Posteel.</p>
<p>ORE - Europa - 100,000 tonnes ore Boca Grande/Dunkirk E end June $7.35 fio 40,000 shinc/three days shinc Bocimar.</p>
<p>TBN - 100,000/110,000 tonnes ore Norfolk/El Dekheila 15-30/7 $6.95 flo 35,000 shinc/18,000 shinc Coe and Clerici.</p>
</text>
